meta {
  name: Get My Content's Year
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user/my_year
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get My Content's Year

  This request is used to get all available year to selected in filter based on created date inventory or report. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — user year fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "user year fetched",
    "data": [
      { "year": 2023 }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login | permission denied. only admin can use this request"
  }
```

  **404 — user year failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "user year not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}